  "definition": "Rate Setting and Payment Limitations for Atypical Nursing Care",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-07-10",
  "historyNote": "#8547, eff 1-24-06 (formerly He-W 593.38); ss by #10474, 1-24-14; ss by #14020, eff 7-10-24",
